{%- comment -%} The comparator, the number (the digits of the record; decimals: at most that many places) and the unit (unit, else code). The number and the unit
are marked (fx-quantity-number, fx-quantity-unit) so that a narrow row cuts the digits, never the unit {%- endcomment -%}
{%- assign unit = self.unit | default: self.code -%}
{{- self.comparator -}}
<span class="fx-quantity-number">{{- self.value | fhir_number: decimals -}}</span>
{%- if unit -%}
  {{- " " -}}<span class="fx-quantity-unit">{{- unit -}}</span>
{%- endif -%}
